      districtGovernance: "Each of the 75 districts is headed by a District Magistrate and Collector, with districts grouped into 18 divisions under Divisional Commissioners and tehsils and blocks below; the DM-SP pairing remains the pivot of both revenue and law-and-order administration. Rural local government runs on three tiers of gram panchayats, kshetra panchayats and zila panchayats, and the state also has a large tier of municipal corporations, nagar palika parishads and nagar panchayats. NOTE: the counts of 75 districts and 18 divisions reflect the long-standing administrative structure and were not independently re-verified against the state portal in this compilation.",
